        <mxCell id="fix-ext-bb" parent="fix-ext" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#808080;fontColor=light-dark(#2E2E2E,#F0F0F0);fontSize=12;" value="Bitbucket&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;OAuth / repo import&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="150" x="15" y="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fix-ext-cap" parent="fix-ext" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=light-dark(#2E2E2E,#F0F0F0);strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;configured in gitlab.rb&lt;br&gt;(templates_tpl/user_data.tpl)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="160" x="10" y="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fix-notes" parent="sGtHwoEF5G3cdS0aJBlE-97" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=light-dark(#2E2E2E,#F0F0F0);fontSize=12;spacing=12;rounded=1;arcSize=4;dashed=1;strokeColor=#808080;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes (as implemented in this repository)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Public DNS zone and SES live in the Root Account and are managed outside Terraform; ACM is validated via DNS there.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The Private Hosted Zone uses the same domain (split-horizon) and points to the ALB private IPs; runners reach GitLab through it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Runners: 6 Auto Scaling Groups per architecture (small / medium / large × shared / dedicated), desired_capacity = 0. Shared = Spot; dedicated = On-Demand, warm pool on small and medium.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• ASG ARM - MacOS is commented out in main.tf.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Cache* bucket is created, but runners currently use a local /cache volume.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Alarms (CPU, memory, disk) publish to SNS; a failed EC2 status check triggers an automatic reboot.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• CodePipeline / CodeBuild are created outside Terraform; the buildspecs live in /codepipeline." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="370" x="20" y="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="Disaster Recovery" id="-qWOoJgoIilXa71qMSej">
    <mxGraphModel dx="4787" dy="1953" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
